      "title": "Габаритные чертежи ОПН 15 кВ (0,8 Кл и 1,1 Кл разделы, одинаковые обозначения)",
      "description": "Each section shows two side-by-side views of the arrester: left view labelled «III СЗ» with shed diameter dimension Ø98, right view labelled «IV СЗ» with shed diameter dimension Ø126. A vertical dimension 216±1 spans the full height of each insulator body (top fitting base to bottom fitting base). A small vertical dimension 10 appears at the top terminal region and another 10 at the bottom terminal region of each view. M10 appears at the top connection and bottom connection of each view, indicating the terminal threaded-hole size. The drawings are outline/section views without other visible labels; ambiguity: exact endpoints of the small '10' dimensions (whether fitting height above/below the shed) cannot be determined with certainty from resolution.",
